This distribution contains original LightCone-Spec code and plain unified
diffs for SGLang. SGLang is licensed under Apache-2.0 and is not distributed
with this repository. The diffs add the experimental online-adaptation,
backend, distributed-publication, reset, and telemetry paths used by the paper
protocol.

The OnlineSPEC comparison is an independent implementation based on the paper
and public reference project at https://github.com/ZinYY/OnlineSPEC. No
OnlineSPEC source code is copied into this repository.

Models and datasets are external artifacts. They are not distributed by this
repository and remain subject to their respective licenses and terms.
